OL,3,AHouseholds braced for soaring energy   
OL,4,Abills with new price cap to be         
OL,5,Aannounced                              
OL,7,FDomestic energy bills are expected to  
OL,8,Fsoar in January for millions of        
OL,9,Fhouseholds, with regulator Ofgem to    
OL,10,Fannounce the precise increase shortly. 
OL,12,FA typical annual bill is predicted to  
OL,13,Frise by 26% in the new year, according 
OL,14,Fto consultancy Cornwall Insight, in a  
OL,15,Fforecast made ahead of the official    
OL,16,Fannouncement.                          
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
