OL,3,AHouseholds braced for soaring energy   
OL,4,Abills with new price cap to be         
OL,5,Aannounced                              
OL,7,FOfgem's new cap, which sets a maximum  
OL,8,Fprice for each unit of energy, will    
OL,9,Fcome into force at the coldest time of 
OL,10,Fyear. Customers pay for what they use  
OL,11,Fand charities and suppliers expect debt
OL,12,Fto rise and a wave of people to need   
OL,13,Femergency support.                     
OL,15,FThe government will make a #100 payment
OL,16,Fto millions of households to help cover
OL,17,Fwinter costs, in addition to an ongoing
OL,18,FVAT cut on electricity.                
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2 
